{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And I will turn to you.</b> To increase your wealth, and to make you fruitful and multiply you with sons and daughters. The correct interpretation in my eyes is that \"and I will make you fruitful\" is the opposite of \"shutting the womb.\"" "<b>And I will establish My covenant with you.</b> That you be as the stars of the heavens for multitude and as the dust of the earth."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:36.647908686Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}